# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
@mixin size {
  width: 100%;
}

.card {
  margin: 1px 2px 3px 4px;
  inset-block-start: 1px;
  inset-block-end: 2px;
  padding: #{$space} 2px;
  margin: $space 2px;
  padding-block-start: #{$space};
  padding-block-end: 2px;
}

```

